{"id":"css-i-javascript-primera-aproximacio","title":"CSS i JavaScript_primera aproximació","topic":"html","topicLabel":"HTML","tags":["aprendizaje","javascript","css"],"course":null,"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"¿Qué es?","id":"que-es"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)","id":"como-se-escribe-sintaxis"}],"readingMins":1,"codeBlocks":0.5,"words":66,"backlinks":[{"id":"sesion-09-20-05-26","title":"Sesion_09_20.05.26","topicLabel":"HTML","session":9}],"html":"<h2 id=\"que-es\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Qué es?</h2><p>Un lloc web modern es divideix en tres capes: l&#39;<strong>HTML</strong> defineix l&#39;estructura, el <strong>CSS</strong> s&#39;encarrega del disseny visual (colors, lletres, marges) i el <strong>JavaScript</strong> aporta el comportament i la interactivitat (botons que fan coses, missatges, etc.).</p>\n<h2 id=\"como-se-escribe-sintaxis\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)</h2><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">Html</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">style</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"language-css\"> \n\t<span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">body</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-family</span>: Arial; } \n\t<span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">h1</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">color</span>: navy; } \n</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">style</span>&gt;</span> [cite: 729-734] \n\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">script</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"language-javascript\"> \n\t<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">saludar</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) { <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">alert</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Hola!&quot;</span>); }\n</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">script</span>&gt;</span> [cite: 741-744]</code></pre></div>"}